	)
	(text "DESIGN NOTES (S32K3xx data sheet; S32K3 Hardware Design Guidelines Rev E2; Node60 compute page)\nGATE-MCU-01 PASSED 2026-10-28: all 257 balls and every planned function checked against NXP IOMUX (Nov 2025), IBIS and\n  BSDL (257BGA); signed off by the user. Re-run for DEC-018 (8 balls) passed 2026-10-30. Re-run it if the pin plan changes. The pin table above each unit is the plan.\nSupplies: VDD_HV_A = VDD_HV_B = VREFH = 3V3_MAIN, V15 = 1V5_CORE (U303), V11/V25 internal (decoupling only).\n  NTC dividers are ratiometric to 3V3_MAIN = VREFH. Check the S32K3 supply ramp-rate limits against the LMQ66430\n  soft start (HDG 2.10.1) during bring-up.\nClock: 16 MHz crystal on FXOSC (DEC-015), core and peripherals via PLL; CMU monitors FXOSC. Unused GPIOs\n  unconnected (disabled), as NXP HDG Rev E2 Table 33 requires. RESET_B pulled up to VDD_HV_A (4.7k on p3), as Table 33 requires.\nWatchdog: internal SWT, hard-locked after start-up (DEC-005). Clock monitor CMU -> reset.\nRESET_B (PTA5) on RESET_L: TPS3702 window supervisor (p3) wired-OR, PHY RESET_N, debug header pin 10.\nFlash IS25LP032D-JNLA3 on LPSPI2, mode 0 or 3, own CS with 10k pull-up so it is deselected through reset;\n  WP and HOLD pulled up (single-IO SPI). Powered from switched 3V3_MAIN; log flush before PHY sleep (DEC-007).\nDebug: Cortex 10-pin (project default). Pin 7 is the key, pin 8 unused. SWDIO 10k up, SWCLK 10k down.\nDefault states: all port pins are disabled inputs out of reset; LPSPI3/4/5 PCS0 and LPSPI2 PCS0 are held high by\n  each switch's internal pull-up and R4xx respectively; FLT and IRQ lines idle high via their pull-ups.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 398.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3fadf9cf-8052-59cb-a596-d78c5bff1418")
	)
	(text "RMII REF_CLK enters on EMAC TX_CLK (RM: 'EMAC transmitter clock / RMII clock').\nLPI2C0: INA228 0x40. LPI2C1 (PTC6/PTC7): TMP175 0x48. Standard/fast mode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 360.68 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42d1570e-abcb-5dff-9f14-50e5661d8627")
	)
	(text "One LPSPI bus per TPS2HCS08 (DEC-018): LPSPI4 = U601, LPSPI5 = U701, LPSPI3 = U801.\nSPI mode 1 (CPOL 0, CPHA 1), 8 MHz max, 32-bit frames with CRC. Each PCS0 idles high from reset\n(switch internal pull-up): channels stay off until configured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 541.02 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "61652c0d-526e-5d24-88d7-83b7ad5de107")
	)
